{"id":"ce876585d129ce97","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","title":"Metric Space","display":"df-metric-space — Metric Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-metric-space","aliases":["58-df-metric-space","Metric Space","58-df-zfc-metric-space"],"display":"df-metric-space — Metric Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-metric]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-metric-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-metric-space</span><span>Metric Space</span><span>58-df-zfc-metric-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-metric-space — Metric Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"58-df-metric\">58-df-metric</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d: X \\times X \\to \\mathbb{R}_{\\geq 0}\">\\(d: X \\times X \\to \\mathbb{R}_{\\geq 0}\\)</span> (distance function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\)</span> (defined here; metric space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Symmetric}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Symmetric}_S\\)</span> (symmetry predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TriangleInequality}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TriangleInequality}_S\\)</span> (triangle-inequality predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricSpace}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(d,X\\times X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)=0\\leftrightarrow x=y)\\land\\mathrm{Symmetric}_S(d,X)\\land\\mathrm{TriangleInequality}_S(d,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(d,X\\times X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)=0\\leftrightarrow x=y)\\land\\mathrm{Symmetric}_S(d,X)\\land\\mathrm{TriangleInequality}_S(d,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}symmetry} \\vdash \\mathrm{Symmetric}_S(d,X)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)=d(y,x))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}symmetry} \\vdash \\mathrm{Symmetric}_S(d,X)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)=d(y,x))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}triangle\\text{-}inequality} \\vdash \\mathrm{TriangleInequality}_S(d,X)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(d(x,z)\\leq d(x,y)+d(y,z))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}triangle\\text{-}inequality} \\vdash \\mathrm{TriangleInequality}_S(d,X)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(d(x,z)\\leq d(x,y)+d(y,z))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}space\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}space\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Metric: distance satisfying positivity, symmetry, triangle</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span> with Euclidean metric, discrete metric</li>\n<li>Cauchy: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall \\varepsilon &gt; 0,\\; \\exists N,\\; d(x_m, x_n) &lt; \\varepsilon\">\\(\\forall \\varepsilon &gt; 0,\\; \\exists N,\\; d(x_m, x_n) &lt; \\varepsilon\\)</span></li>\n<li>Complete: every Cauchy sequence converges</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-metric","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-metric]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"d: X \\times X \\to \\mathbb{R}_{\\geq 0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Symmetric}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TriangleInequality}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(d,X\\times X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)=0\\leftrightarrow x=y)\\land\\mathrm{Symmetric}_S(d,X)\\land\\mathrm{TriangleInequality}_S(d,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}symmetry} \\vdash \\mathrm{Symmetric}_S(d,X)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)=d(y,x))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}triangle\\text{-}inequality} \\vdash \\mathrm{TriangleInequality}_S(d,X)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(d(x,z)\\leq d(x,y)+d(y,z))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}space\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall \\varepsilon > 0,\\; \\exists N,\\; d(x_m, x_n) < \\varepsilon","display":false}],"bytes":1709,"backlinks":[{"id":"31d8b0606c7450fa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]])"},{"id":"617975928ef03517","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$d_2(x,y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(n,x,y)$（欧氏度量，see [[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]）"},{"id":"199139c5a60bcfcc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)$（see [[../